24 24\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"17 11 19 13 23 9\"></polyline></svg><span class=\"on_follow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Follow demigodofwine</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following demigodofwine</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fdemigodofwine.itch.io%2Fresonance-constant&amp;intent=add_to_collection\" class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a href=\"https://demigodofwine.itch.io/resonance-constant#comments\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a href=\"https://demigodofwine.itch.io/resonance-constant/devlog\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/5075073/resonance-constant\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_anonymous-pro\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Resonance Constant\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzgxMTA0LnBuZw==/original/EP8ZFi.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Resonance Constant</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download\" id=\"view_game_8505237\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows, macOS, and Linux</p><div class=\"direct_download_row\"><button class=\"button direct_download_btn\" type=\"button\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_download\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden width=\"22\" height=\"22\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> Download</button></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p></p>\r\n<h2>A free demo of Resonance Constant</h2>\r\n<p>After the Resonance, the city&#x27;s surface was swallowed by the Ash Field: anyone who goes up there loses their way and is never seen again. A technician wakes up in the staff room of Sector 17 station. On the table lies a map of the metro line. Somewhere at the end of it is the Resonance Node, where it all began.\r\n</p>\r\n<h2>What&#x27;s in the demo</h2>\r\n<ul><li><strong>Story &mdash; Sector 17, the first station, in full.</strong>&nbsp;The dark corridors and buildings around the station, the generator room, a battle hall, side rooms and the Keeper&#x27;s lair below. The Keeper is one of six, different from run to run. Find two panel parts, defeat the Keeper and board the train car.\r\n</li><li><strong>Purge &mdash; stage 1.</strong>&nbsp;A supply crate, four halls with waves of Shades (in the first two the emergency light flickers on its own) and the Swarm in the fifth hall.\r\n</li><li><strong>Your progress carries over.</strong>&nbsp;The full version picks up your demo save and the Purge stage you unlocked on the same computer.\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<p>The full game is in development: five stations down the line, six lair Keepers, the Resonance Heart and all six Purge stages.\r\n</p>\r\n<h2>Light is your weapon</h2>\r\n<p>The corridors are dark. Your flashlight burns while the battery lasts, and only in the light can you see the Shades. The shotgun and the flare gun hurt a Shade at full strength only when it stands in the light: in your beam, in a lit sector, under a floodlight. In the dark they do a quarter of the damage.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>A power cell can go into your pack to make the battery last longer. Or you can give it to the generator room: a sector lights up for good, and no new Shades appear there. Every power cell is a choice.\r\n</p>\r\n<h2>Features</h2>\r\n<ul><li>A station area with its own layout every run: corridors, buildings, side rooms, a battle hall\r\n</li><li>Combat where light decides everything: flashlight, floodlights, generators, glowsticks, light bombs\r\n</li><li>A lair Keeper with its own tricks and weakness\r\n</li><li>Gear upgrades from crates and levels 1–5 for resonance shards\r\n</li><li>A pixel-art Soviet metro: whitewashed walls, tiles and tunnel rings\r\n</li><li>Keyboard and mouse or gamepad, rebindable controls\r\n</li><li>English and Russian\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<h2>Controls</h2>\r\n<p>WASD &mdash; move · Mouse &mdash; aim · LMB / RMB &mdash; the items in your hands · F &mdash; flashlight · E &mdash; interact · Tab &mdash; backpack and gear · M &mdash; line map · J &mdash; log · Esc &mdash; pause. Gamepad supported. Keys, language and brightness &mdash; Settings in the main menu.\r\n</p>\r\n<h2>System requirements</h2>\r\n<ul><li><strong>Windows:</strong>&nbsp;Windows 10 or 11, 64-bit\r\n</li><li><strong>macOS:</strong>&nbsp;Intel or Apple Silicon\r\n</li><li><strong>Linux:</strong>&nbsp;x86_64\r\n</li><li>Graphics with OpenGL 3.3 (on Windows &mdash; or DirectX 11), 4 GB RAM, 300 MB of disk space\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<h2>Install notes</h2>\r\n<p>The game is not code-signed yet, so your system may warn you on the first launch.\r\n</p>\r\n<ul><li><strong>Windows:</strong>&nbsp;if SmartScreen says &quot;Windows protected your PC&quot;, click&nbsp;<strong>More info → Run anyway</strong>.\r\n</li><li><strong>macOS:</strong>&nbsp;if macOS says the app &quot;is damaged&quot; or can&#x27;t be verified, open it once, then go to&nbsp;<strong>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security</strong>&nbsp;and click&nbsp;<strong>Open Anyway</strong>. Or run in Terminal:&nbsp;<code>xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine &quot;/path/to/Resonance Constant Demo.app&quot;</code>\r\n</li><li><strong>Linux:</strong>&nbsp;if the file won&#x27;t start, make it executable:&nbsp;<code>chmod +x ResonanceConstantDemo.x86_64</code>\r\n</li><li>Keep&nbsp;<code>ResonanceConstantDemo.pck</code>&nbsp;next to the executable &mdash; it holds the game data.\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<p>Saves:&nbsp;<code>%APPDATA%\\ResonanceConstant</code>&nbsp;(Windows),&nbsp;<code>~/Library/Application Support/ResonanceConstant</code>&nbsp;(macOS),&nbsp;<code>~/.local/share/ResonanceConstant</code>&nbsp;(Linux).\r\n</p>\r\n<h2>Credits</h2>\r\n<p>Made with Godot Engine (MIT license). Graphics, sound and music were made for this game. &copy; 2026 Zasvet.</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg width=\"12\" height=\"6\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_8198164\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"29 September 2026 @ 17:17 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 1 hour ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-osx\">macOS</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-linux\">Linux</a></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href=\"https://demigodofwine.itch.io\">demigodofwine</a></td></tr><tr><td>Genre</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-survival\">Survival</a></td></tr><tr><td>Made with</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/made-with-godot\">Godot</a></td></tr><tr><td>Tags</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-atmospheri